      "name": "No Prisoners",
      "description": "Break a fortified garrison — and take its soldiers alive. The prison and torture chamber turn captured heroes into your own dead.",
      "author": "Deep Dominion Team",
      "intro": [
        "Death wastes a good soldier. The garrison at the crossing is walled and well-drilled,",
        "but every knight who falls at your gate is a knight who could rise again in your service.",
        "Raise a prison and a torture chamber, take the heroes alive, and break them in the dark —",
        "as skeletons and turncoats they will march back against the very banners they once served.",
        "Then pull down the outpost stone by stone and make the crossing yours."
